# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ZodiacPatent Attorney Email Automation - backend configuration (Hostinger Email)
#
# setup.bat copies this file to "backend/.env". Then open backend/.env in
# Notepad and paste your Hostinger App Password after SMTP_PASS=
# Never commit or share the .env file, and never put the password anywhere else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Hostinger outgoing mail server. Port 465 uses SSL (SMTP_SECURE=true).
# (Alternative: SMTP_PORT=587 with SMTP_SECURE=false uses STARTTLS.)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.hostinger.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true

# The full ZodiacPatent mailbox address you log in as (for example
# someone@zodiacpatent.com). To switch mailboxes, change SMTP_USER, SMTP_FROM
# and SMTP_PASS together, save, and restart the app. No code changes needed.
SMTP_USER=your-mailbox@zodiacpatent.com

# The App Password generated in Hostinger hPanel:
#   Emails > Mailboxes > (this mailbox) > three dots > App passwords
# NOT your hPanel login password and NOT the normal mailbox password.
SMTP_PASS=

# Address the emails are sent from. Must be the same mailbox as SMTP_USER
# (with EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend: an address on a domain verified in Resend).
SMTP_FROM=your-mailbox@zodiacpatent.com

# Local ports - leave these unless you know you need to change them.
PORT=4000
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional on this computer: shared team login. Leave these commented out to
# use the app locally without signing in (it only listens on 127.0.0.1).
# On Render they are REQUIRED - see DEPLOYMENT.md. Generate the hash with:
#   cd backend && npm run hash-password -- --secret
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# APP_USERNAME=zodiac-team
# APP_PASSWORD_HASH=
# SESSION_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: send through the Resend HTTPS API instead of Hostinger SMTP (used on
# Render Free, which blocks SMTP ports). On this computer, keep "smtp".
#   EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend   needs RESEND_API_KEY and SMTP_FROM only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: shared MongoDB database (Atlas M0 Free). Without MONGODB_URI the app
# keeps using the files in backend/data. The connection string is a SECRET:
# never commit it, paste it in chat, or pass it on a command line. The database
# scripts never print it. See DATABASE-OPERATIONS.md before running any of them.
#   MONGODB_DB must be set explicitly: the scripts refuse an assumed database.
#   MONGODB_PRODUCTION_DBS: extra database names treated as production (always
#     includes "zodiacpatent"); restore never writes into them.
#   ACTIVITY_RETENTION_DAYS: delete team-activity entries older than this many
#     days (minimum 90). Unset = keep forever. Sending history is never deleted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MONGODB_URI=
# MONGODB_DB=
# TEAM_MEMBERS=Vikram,Darshan
# MONGODB_PRODUCTION_DBS=
# ACTIVITY_RETENTION_DAYS=
